% holding-blocked: The original is fully notated in two parts and its listening reference is verified, but it has not been played by a class. A Malian/Songhai music educator must review the style framing, the cultural context and whether the title's "Sahel" implies a style the piece does not have; a Grade 8 music teacher must trial the ground and the texture changes; a second score reader must check the audit.
